  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Storm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: Storm
  Prompt: As you settle into your tents for the night, you begin to hear a trickle
    of rain. You sleep uneasily, and are soon awoken by a crash of thunder and sudden
    explosive downpour. The horrific torrent tears open your tent, dousing your party
    in frigid water. You are forced to make cover under an overhanging boulder, almost
    freezing to death in the midnight chill. The next day, you are certainly worse
    for the wear.
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 1
  Choices:
  - Text: Shiver.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: The next morning is fortunately bright, and the sun warms the clothes
        on your backs. Much of your gear and food managed to stay dry, and you reflect
        that you've survived worse. Still, you all feel incredibly tired and beaten
        down.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 8
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 5
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
